      "message": "[error] Line 1218: 🔴 When `rtcpProtection_` is enabled, failed SRTCP decryption currently falls back to parsing the packet as plaintext. That accepts unauthenticated RTCP in DTLS-SRTP sessions (e.g., spoofed PLI/FIR/REMB), which defeats RTCP integrity/authentication guarantees. Fix by dropping RTCP packets on decrypt failure whenever `rtcpProtection_` is true, and keep plaintext parsing only when protection is disabled.",
