      "message": "[error] Line 1505: 🔴 Incoming re-INVITE handling updates `rtcpMuxEnabled_` but does not re-evaluate `bundleEnabled_`. If the peer removes BUNDLE (or BUNDLE becomes ineligible), the call can keep stale bundled transport assumptions (ICE stream/component counts, shared sockets) and break the intended non-BUNDLE fallback. Add `setBundleEnabled(accountSupportsBundle(account) \u0026\u0026 remoteOfferSupportsBundle())` alongside `setRtcpMuxEnabled(...)` before SDP processing.",
