      "message": "[error] Line 3726: 🔴 In the \u0027offer-in-200-OK\u0027 path (late offer), transport mode flags are not synchronized with the received SDP before media/ICE setup. With RTCP mux now default-enabled, this can leave stale mux/bundle state when the remote offer does not advertise them, leading to wrong socket/component setup. After `setReceivedOffer(offer)`, recompute both `setRtcpMuxEnabled(account-\u003eisRtcpMuxEnabled() \u0026\u0026 remoteOfferSupportsRtcpMux())` and `setBundleEnabled(accountSupportsBundle(acc) \u0026\u0026 remoteOfferSupportsBundle())` before `processIncomingOffer(...)`.",
